              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "فلکه (falake) — \"a roundabout (US: a traffic circle)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "هتل ما کنار فلکه اول است. Hotel-e mâ kenâr-e falake-ye avval ast. Our hotel is next to the first roundabout."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Many big roundabouts are also called meydân."
            }
          ]
        },
