              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بچه ها با دقت از خیابان عبور کردند. Bachche-hâ bâ deqqat az khiyâbân 'obur kardand. The children crossed the street carefully."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "More formal than rad shodan. 'Obur mamnu' — no crossing."
            }
